: \"text\", \"q\": \"The aIRRs during the peak month of each surge were compared across income strata using the Wald’s test\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Time (number of months since data collection began in March 2020) and vaccination coverage were included in the model as polynomial splines\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"pairwise contrasts of Wald’s test, with p-values adjusted using Tukey’s method for multiple comparisons\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Statistical tests were performed using R software (version 4.1.1; R Foundation).\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}